     :item/answer ["¿Dónde van a estudiar? Vamos a estudiar en una universidad en Costa Rica."]}
    {:item/n 18,
     :item/prompt ["You all have to pay a deposit."],
     :item/answer ["Tienen que pagar un depósito."]}
    {:item/n 19,
     :item/prompt ["You are all not going to spend much money in these vacations."],
     :item/answer ["No van a gastar mucho dinero en estas vacaciones."]}
    {:item/n 20,
     :item/prompt ["Do you all want to find a house (in order ) to rent?"],
     :item/answer ["¿Quieren encontrar una casa para rentar?"]}
    {:item/n 21,
     :item/prompt
     ["When are you all going to start your Spanish classes? We are going to start in July."],
     :item/answer ["¿Cuándo van a empezar sus clases de español? Vamos a empezar en julio."]}
    {:item/n 22,
     :item/prompt ["I always have to study a lot the week before the exams."],
     :item/answer ["Siempre tengo que estudiar mucho la semana antes de los exámenes."]}
    {:item/n 23,
     :item/prompt ["Do you all want to buy something special?"],
     :item/answer ["¿Quieren comprar algo especial?"]}
    {:item/n 24,
     :item/prompt ["Are you all going to pay with a credit card?"],
     :item/answer ["¿Van a pagar con una tarjeta de crédito?"]}
    {:item/n 25,
     :item/prompt
     ["If you all want to study Spanish, this method is good in order to learn fast."],
