    {:item/n 26,
     :item/prompt
     ["Are you all going to (arrive) go by (en) car? No, we are going to (arrive) go by train."],
     :item/answer ["¿Van a llegar en coche? No, vamos a llegar en tren."]}
    {:item/n 27,
     :item/prompt ["You all always need to confirm the reservations a day before."],
     :item/answer ["Siempre necesitan confirmar las reservaciones un día antes."]}
    {:item/n 28,
